[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_0qwdf")
dialogue_id = "debate_cooperation"
record_title = "Debate Speech: Cooperation"
text = "PAGE: historian(PORTAL_NETWORK), AUDIENCE
historian: I have recently learned of an old shard that to this day does not have a capital.
historian: They have no shard council or central treasury.
historian: They can't even agree on a standard unit of measurement.
historian: By all conventional logic, a place like that should have collapsed the moment a bad storm rolled in.
historian: And a bad storm did roll in, devastating an entire town.
historian: But instead of being left to die, the locals found themselves overrun by thatchers and masons from neighboring villages.
historian: These workers showed up entirely unprompted and started fixing the roofs.
historian: Our political philosophers tell us that without an authority to maintain order, people would turn on each other.
historian: But this shard shows us that cooperation doesn't need to be enforced by law.
historian: When the roof caves in, helping your neighbor lift the beam is what allowed us to survive to this day.
historian: It is a fundamental instinct we humans possess.
historian: We do not need a grand empire to make us work together.
historian: We just need to listen to our conscience."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://jtkfcsyiryo4"
